# Phase Completion Checklist

Invoke manually with `@phase-completion-checklist` when finishing a phase or vertical slice.

- [ ] Scope limited to the assigned phase/slice only
- [ ] No hardcoded content, IDs, secrets, or env values in app code
- [ ] Layers respected (UI does not call Firestore/Google APIs directly)
- [ ] Security: server role checks for any admin mutation introduced
- [ ] Design tokens only; approved palette unchanged without ADR
- [ ] Typecheck / lint / tests / production build (Phase 1+)
- [ ] Manual verification of changed surfaces
- [ ] Motion review skill used if motion code changed
- [ ] Report written in the required format
- [ ] Stopped — next phase not started
